<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Newport News starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Newport News starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it had started coverage of Newport News Shipbuilding Inc with a rating of near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The Newport News, Va., company's shares opened unchanged at 15-3/4 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
